            "text": "Looking for advanced electro stimulation with more precision, control, and flexibility? The <strong>ElectraStim Linx</strong> is a next-generation dual-channel electro stimulator designed to deliver powerful and fully customizable sensations through premium hardware and smart connectivity. With over <strong>20 built-in stimulation patterns</strong>, <strong>99 independent intensity levels per channel</strong>, and Bluetooth app integration, it offers a highly adaptable experience for both stand-alone and interactive play. Finished with a high-contrast OLED display, tactile controls, USB-C rechargeable power, and remote-play functionality, <strong>Linx</strong> is a premium choice for users seeking modern electro play with performance, versatility, and long-term reliability.",
