          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features & experience",
            "accordion_image": "shopify://shop_images/product-characteristics-icon_b10c6a41-572f-447e-8d84-56f4609057fc.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>The <strong>ElectraStim Linx</strong> is designed for users who want a more refined and customizable electro stimulation experience. Its <strong>dual-channel system</strong> allows each channel to operate independently, making it possible to tailor intensity and stimulation across different accessories or setups with greater precision. This creates a more controlled, layered, and versatile experience suited to individual preferences.</p><p>Used on its own, Linx offers more than <strong>20 built-in stimulation patterns</strong> and a highly detailed control system with <strong>99 intensity levels per channel</strong>. When paired with the <strong>ElectraStim Linx App</strong> via Bluetooth, it unlocks even more advanced options, including interactive play modes, detailed frequency adjustments, and stimulation that can respond to movement, sound, or audio. The result is a deeply personalized system built for both immediate enjoyment and broader exploration.</p>{{ block.settings.page.content }}",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_PQya4J": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product information",
            "accordion_image": "shopify://shop_images/product-info-icon_a8db015b-ddf4-4acd-97f6-bcb1fc623814.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>The <strong>ElectraStim Linx</strong> is a <strong>dual-channel electro stimulator</strong> featuring <strong>20+ built-in stimulation patterns</strong> for stand-alone use and <strong>99 independent intensity levels per channel</strong> for highly precise control. It also includes <strong>Bluetooth connectivity</strong> with the free ElectraStim Linx App, which unlocks <strong>10 interactive stimulation and control modes</strong> as well as expanded customization features. Its <strong>symmetrical bi-phasic output</strong> is designed to create smoother stimulation, while the <strong>OLED display</strong> and tactile physical controls provide a clear and intuitive user experience.</p><p>The device is powered by a <strong>USB-C rechargeable battery</strong> with <strong>up to 6 hours of use</strong> and includes <strong>user-updatable firmware</strong> for future improvements and feature support. In the box, users receive <strong>1 ElectraStim Linx Electro Stimulator</strong>, <strong>1 zipped protective storage case</strong>, <strong>1 detachable belt clip</strong>, <strong>4 self-adhesive ElectraPads</strong>, <strong>2 connecting cables with 2 mm pin connectors</strong>, <strong>1 USB-C charging cable</strong>, <strong>1 free extended warranty card</strong>, and <strong>1 quick-start guide</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_CDVNV9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why you'll love it",
            "accordion_image": "shopify://shop_images/why-youll-love-it-icon_cfeb8990-ada5-4667-b824-aee5a0ca42cc.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>One of the standout qualities of the <strong>ElectraStim Linx</strong> is its ability to combine <strong>precision, flexibility, and modern connectivity</strong> in one powerful device. It works beautifully as a stand-alone stimulator for users who prefer direct control, but it also expands into a much more interactive experience when connected to the app. This makes it a strong choice for anyone who values both simplicity and advanced customization in the same device.</p><p>Its independent dual channels, remote-play functionality, and future-ready firmware also make it especially appealing for users who want a system that can grow with their preferences over time. Premium, adaptable, and built for long-term performance, <strong>Linx</strong> is an excellent choice for those seeking a more sophisticated electro stimulation experience with greater control and versatility.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
